# language_list.dat - By TyRaS-SW
# Available languages for the overlay
# Order defines the cycle order of the "Switch Language" button.
# One language code per line.
#
# To add a new language:
#   1. Add its code below (e.g. "fr" for French).
#   2. Create scripts/lang/MENUMSG_fr.dat
#      (You can copy MENUMSG_es.dat and edit ONLY the right text. Left and right text are separated by an '=')
#   3. Create scripts/lang/ASMENU_fr.dat
#      (You can copy ASMENU_en.dat and edit ONLY the right text. Left and right text are separated by an '=')
#   4. Create scripts/lang/OSDMSG_fr.dat
#      (You can copy OSDMSG_en.dat and edit ONLY the right text. Left and right text are separated by an '=')
#   5. Restart mpv (or send: script-message reload-lang)

en
es
jp